### MON SMOKEE smoke test - Bước 2 hạ tầng

### 1. Lấy CSRF token
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### 2. POST không gửi CSRF - mong đợi 403
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. POST có CSRF - backend bước auth chưa làm nên mong đợi 501
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: paste-token-tu-cau-1

{}
